PTX WAR+ld+bulk-copy.remote
"CTA 1 reads its shared location, then arrives remotely on CTA 0's mbarrier; CTA 0 waits and overwrites the location with a bulk copy: can the read see the later value?"
{
g=7;
d=5 @cta 1;
e=mbarrier(1) @cta 0;
b=mbarrier(1) @cta 1;
P0:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0                                                  | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                          ;
 mbarrier.try_wait.parity.acquire.cluster r0, e, 0                         | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, d                         ;
 cp.async.bulk.shared::cluster.global.mbarrier::complete_tx::bytes d, g, b | mbarrier.arrive.release.cluster.shared::cluster e ;
exists
(P0:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 7)
